<title>UK: London tea sale average price.</title>
<headline>London tea sale average price.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average for the 4,446 packages of landed tea sold at this weeks London sale was 128.00 pence a kilo against 116.97 last week and 112.01 a year ago.</p>
<p>The average for the 37,511 pkgs sold so far this year is 116.55 pence against 114.53 pence for the 47,186 pkgs sold by this stage last year.</p>
